  "bodyHash": "c58b6f22b865b6af",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">物品交接（Hand Over Your Items）是一款允许玩家在不将物品掉落在地上的情况下，将物品交给其他人的模组。你不想让朋友刚烤好的面包沾上泥土吧？默认情况下，玩家需要蹲下并右键点击另一位玩家才能进行物品交接。主手<strong>中的整个物品组都会被交出。如果目标玩家的背包没有空间，物品将会掉落在地上。<br><br>默认情况下，每位玩家都会收到一条消息，这可以在配置文件中更改。可以仅在服务器端使用，但这可能会导致客户端不同步。建议服务器和客户端都安装。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum&#x27;s Extra Bundle 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendItemReceivedMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，玩家在接收物品时会收到一条消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendItemGivenMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，玩家在交出物品时会收到一条消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustCrouchToGiveItem</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，玩家只有在蹲下/潜行时才能交出物品。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一名玩家向另一名玩家交付物品：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hand-over-your-items/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"762\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">交付物品的玩家将物品退回：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hand-over-your-items/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"762\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这里目标玩家的背包空间不足，因此物品被掉落在地上：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hand-over-your-items/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"762\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注和链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载仍然托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在众多独立的模组页面中跟踪评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事情，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
